[statement]
A requested name keeps its choice against a name packages only provide
only where the request admits that choice: the request asks for `x<3`,
which `x` 3 does not meet, and `y1`, the best candidate for `Y`, needs
`w`, which only `x` 1 provides. apk installs `x` 1 and `y1`. Contrast
`a-requested-name-some-package-carries-keeps-its-choice-against-a-provided-name`.

[repository]
P:x
V:3

P:x
V:1
p:w=2

P:y1
V:1
k:5
p:Y
D:w

P:y2
V:1
p:Y

[request]
x<3
Y

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install x 1
install y1 1
